# Hedge Shredder (5/5 Vehicle, Crew 1): crewing needs total power 1 (CR 702.122a), so Bot1's Ornithopter (power 0) cannot, and its
# Memnite (power 1, summoning sick, which a crew cost ignores) can. The crewed Shredder attacks, Bot1 accepts "you may mill two cards"
# and the Forest and Mountain it mills are both put onto the battlefield tapped by one ability (CR 603.2c); the Shredder deals its 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Hedge Shredder
Memnite
Ornithopter
Island
Island
Island
Forest
Mountain
Island x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x24

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Hedge Shredder.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
# The Ornithopter's power is 0: it alone does not make a crew of 1.
! Bot1.Battlefield.Hedge Shredder.Activate(Ability: Crew)
Bot1.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Battlefield.Hedge Shredder.Activate(Ability: Crew)
Bot1.Choose(Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Attack(Hedge Shredder > Bot2)
Bot1.Accept
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot2.Life = 15
Bot1.Battlefield = Forest; Hedge Shredder; Memnite; Mountain; Mox Emerald; Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Forest.Tapped = true
Bot1.Battlefield.Mountain.Tapped = true
Bot1.Graveyard = Black Lotus
Bot1.Library.Count = 10
